2026-10-08 11:51:36','2026-10-08 11:51:36'),(341,21,15,'agent:scheduler','[调度] 查询分析完成（证据 5 条，来源 mixed），交由报告决策 Agent',1,25,'{\"agent\": \"scheduler\", \"agent_label\": \"调度\", \"node\": \"scheduler_handoff\", \"next_agent\": \"decision\"}','2026-10-08 11:51:36','2026-10-08 11:51:36'),(342,21,16,'scheduling','[调度] 查询分析完成（证据 5 条，来源 mixed），交由报告决策 Agent',1,25,'{\"agent\": \"scheduler\"}','2026-10-08 11:51:36','2026-10-08 11:51:36'),(343,21,17,'agent:decision','[报告决策 Agent] 差评信号 3 条，规划动作 3 个，风险=high',1,29,'{\"agent\": \"decision\", \"agent_label\": \"报告决策 Agent\", \"node\": \"decide_actions\"}','2026-10-08 11:51:36','2026-10-08 11:51:36'),(344,21,18,'deciding','[报告决策 Agent] 差评信号 3 条，规划动作 3 个，风险=high',1,29,'{\"risk_level\": \"high\", \"agent\": \"decision\"}','2026-10-08 11:51:36','2026-10-08 11:51:36'),(345,21,19,'answering','已根据证据生成回答',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-08 11:51:47','2026-10-08 11:51:47'),(346,21,20,'action_pending','检测到较高风险，请确认是否执行以下动作',1,NULL,'{\"actions\": [{\"type\": \"write_report\", \"title\": \"生成诊断报告\", \"summary\": \"针对问题「静音蓝牙耳机的差评有哪些？」的分析报告，证据 5 条，差评信号 3 条。\", \"product_id\": 3}, {\"type\": \"send_alert\", \"title\": \"触发预警通知\", \"content\": \"该商品检测到 3 条低分评价相关证据，请关注商品口碑。\", \"product_id\": 3, \"level\": \"critical\"}, {\"type\": \"mark_pending_review\", \"title\": \"标记商品待人工复核\", \"product_id\": 3}]}','2026-10-08 11:51:47','2026-10-08 11:51:47'),(347,21,21,'executing','[报告决策 Agent] 已执行 3 个动作',1,NULL,'{\"actions_executed\": [{\"type\": \"write_report\", \"ok\": true, \"report_id\": 10}, {\"type\": \"send_alert\", \"ok\": true, \"alert_id\": 5}, {\"type\": \"mark_pending_review\", \"ok\": true, \"product_id\": 3, \"review_status\": \"pending_review\"}], \"approved\": true}','2026-10-08 11:52:18','2026-10-08 11:52:18');
